# Hot-seat (docs/hotseat.md): England (DS:0x5398, the fixed power) and Spain
# are human, bit 0x80 set; England's caravel is on sentry. The load resumes
# England with @MULTINEXT. England ends its turn, France (AI) moves, and the
# year loop stops at Spain: @MULTINEXT on a blanked screen, the rebind to
# Spain, then Spain's own 00f2 and Move Pieces. Same calendar turn throughout.
key Return                 # English Player Turn
wait 10
key space                  # End of Turn
wait 200
shot                       # Spanish Player Turn over a black screen
key Return
wait 100
